  "geometryEncoding": "Each case has its own origin. A rect [x0, y0, x1, y1] is in UNITS of 0.0001 degrees east/north of the case origin: lng = originLng + x * 0.0001, lat = originLat + y * 0.0001, expanded to a closed GeoJSON Polygon ring. 'rects' is a MultiPolygon of rects. null = the release carries no shape. Fractions are hand-computable because lineage.ts projects with ONE affine projection, which preserves area ratios.",
